OL,3,GNEWSAReform boycotts Senedd after
OL,4,Amember banned for saying white people
OL,5,Aare being replaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK have partially boycotted the
OL,8,FSenedd in protest against a ban on one
OL,9,Fof their politicians for claiming white
OL,10,Fpeople are being "replaced".
OL,12,FThe party's Welsh leader, Helen Jenner,
OL,13,Fsaid Joe Martin's ban was because of
OL,14,F"undue pressure" from governing party
OL,15,FPlaid Cymru and was an "infringement on
OL,16,Ffreedom of speech".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
